4\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're still trying to wrap our heads around it,\\\" said Patersdorf Mayor, Herrmann Müller, in an exclusive interview with our newspaper.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"We had no idea this was in the works.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"But we're proud to be part of this prestigious organization and look forward to working closely with our American partners.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"According to sources within the US Air Force, Patersdorf's unique geography and infrastructure make it an ideal location for ACC operations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"The town's proximity to major European cities, combined with its relatively low population density, make it an attractive site for covert military operations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"We've been eyeing Patersdorf for some time now,\\\" said General James \\\"Hawk\\\" Wilson, Commander of Air Combat Command, in a statement.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"Its strategic location and willingness to cooperate with our forces make it an invaluable asset in our mission to protect American interests abroad.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Data released by the ACC reveals that Patersdorf will serve as a key hub for reconnaissance and surveillance operations, with a focus on monitoring potential security threats in Eastern Europe.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"The town's inclusion in the ACC is expected to bring significant economic benefits, with an estimated €10 million in annual investments and the creation of dozens of new jobs.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Not everyone in Patersdorf is thrilled with the news, however.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Local resident and peace activist, Anna-Lena Klein, expressed concerns about the potential environmental and social impacts of the ACC's presence.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're worried about the noise pollution, the increased traffic, and the potential risks to our community,\\\" Klein 